033500         MOVE 'F1' TO WS-EXCEPTION-CODE
033600         PERFORM WRITE-BUSINESS-EXCEPTION
033700         EXIT PARAGRAPH
033800     END-IF
033900
034000     IF WS-FAMILY-TOTAL + WS-NET-AMOUNT > WS-FAMILY-CAP
034100         COMPUTE WS-NET-AMOUNT =
034200             WS-FAMILY-CAP - WS-FAMILY-TOTAL
034300         MOVE 'C' TO WS-PAYMENT-STATUS
034400     END-IF
034500
034600     PERFORM INSERT-PAYMENT
034700     IF WS-FATAL
034800         EXIT PARAGRAPH
034900     END-IF
035000
035100     PERFORM UPDATE-ENTITLEMENT
035200     IF WS-FATAL
035300         EXIT PARAGRAPH
035400     END-IF
035500
035600     PERFORM WRITE-PAYMENT-DETAIL
035700     ADD WS-NET-AMOUNT TO WS-FAMILY-TOTAL
035800     ADD WS-NET-AMOUNT TO WS-PAYMENT-TOTAL
035900     ADD 1 TO WS-PAYMENT-COUNT.
036000
036100 VALIDATE-ENTITLEMENT.
036200     INITIALIZE SURVIVOR-VALIDATION-AREA
036300     MOVE HV-CLAIM-STATUS TO SV-CLAIM-STATUS
036400     MOVE HV-BENEFICIARY-STATUS TO SV-BENEFICIARY-STATUS
036500     MOVE HV-RELATIONSHIP TO SV-RELATIONSHIP
036600     MOVE HV-BENEFIT-PCT TO SV-BENEFIT-PCT
